ADR-0056 W2 / WI-dukoh. `dependency_unavailable`, `backend_disabled` and
`pass_crashed` were never missing a producer -- they were on the wrong
dataclass. A pass that did not run has no AnalysisRun, and `silence_reason` is
a field ON AnalysisRun, so there was no carrier in existence to stamp. They
move to `limits.skipped_passes[].skip_reason_code`, where their free-text twins
already lived. SCHEMA_VERSION 0.20.8 -> 0.20.9.

ONE CHANNEL, TWO FIELDS. The prose `reason` stays: it carries the pip command
and the exception text, payload a code cannot express. Not a dual write.

THE DRIFT WAS CALLED LATENT; IT IS NOW OBSERVED. pass_silence's own sizing
(490 surveys, 39,757 records, only TWO strings) was honest about its blindness
and wrong about what was concluded from it -- the blindness was a venv, not a
law. A venv without tree-sitter-language-pack, surveying one ordinary repo,
produces 29 skip records in 28 distinct spellings in a single run. The bare
environment was constructed rather than waited for, and the migration is
verified there end to end: 107 of 107 entries classified, 31
dependency_unavailable, ZERO unreported.

FORTY-NINE PRODUCER SITES ACROSS THIRTY-EIGHT FILES, not the "~4 sites, two
f-string templates" this was sized at -- the grammar-missing f-string is
copy-pasted into thirty analyzers, not inherited. Measured before designing
against the estimate.

THE PARSER-INIT FAMILY GETS ITS RULING. Six sites report a parser that failed
to INITIALISE: the grammar is installed and the constructor raised. That is not
dependency_unavailable ("install the package" is the wrong advice) so it is
stamped pass_crashed, whose declaration is true of a caught constructor
exception and says nothing about who contained it. This gives pass_crashed real
producers; ADR-0056 called it speculative on zero instances, which measured the
free-text twin rather than the state.

AN UNCLASSIFIED SKIP READS AS `unreported`, NEVER `no_candidate_files`.
Bucketing a missing code under the value that is 98.94% of all skip records
would manufacture the majority answer for every unconverted producer -- the
absent-versus-empty substitution at the one moment it is easiest to commit. An
AST gate with a synthetic positive control keeps the next analyzer from
reopening the hole.

skipped_passes ALSO GETS ITS FIRST READER. It has been serialized on every
survey since the field existed and nothing ever summarized it. A second stderr
line reports it, kept separate from the pass-silence line because "did not run"
and "ran and found nothing" are different populations with different
denominators.

Three rotted `file:line` citations in module_key_axis re-pointed -- the
inserted imports shifted them, which is what that test exists to catch.

